 Written in the eleventh century, it describes in a poetical form, and in a typically cryptic and allusive language, several facets of Neidan, or internal alchemy. This book presents the first part of the text, consisting of sixteen poems, which contain a concise but comprehensive exposition of Neidan. In addition to notes that intend to clarify the meaning of the more obscure points, the book also contains selections from a commentary dating from the late eighteenth century, which is distinguished by the use of a lucid and plain language.","isbn_10":["0984308210"],"covers":[6277775],"key":"/books/OL23959183M","authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL1424822A","name":"Fabrizio Pregadio"}],"table_of_contents":[{"level":0,"label":"","title":"Preface","pagenum":"vii","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"},"class":"chapter"},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"Introduction","pagenum":"1","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"},"class":"chapter"},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"Translation","pagenum":"21","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"},"class":"chapter"},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"Selections from Liu Yiming's Commentary","pagenum":"75","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"},"class":"chapter"},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"Textual Notes","pagenum":"89","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"},"class":"chapter"},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"Glossary of Chinese Characters","pagenum":"95","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"},"class":"chapter"},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"Works Quoted","pagenum":"101","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"},"class":"chapter"}],"publish_places":["Mountain View, CA"],"isbn_13":["9780984308217"],"pagination":"viii + 102","title":"Awakening to Reality","lccn":["2009912822"],"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"subjects":["Religion / Taoism","Taoism","Alchemy — China"],"publish_date":"2009","by_statement":"Fabrizio Pregadio","oclc_numbers":["539099918"],"works":[{"key":"/works/OL14921816W"}],"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"uris":["http://www.goldenelixir.com/press/trl_01_wuzhenpian.html"],"phy